{"id": "16-1419-2-12", "zh": "velu、celu、kelu、khelu、pelu、belu、selu、sala、tila，用于“行走”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1419-13-14", "zh": "velati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-15-16", "zh": "celati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-17-18", "zh": "kelati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-19-20", "zh": "khelati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-21-22", "zh": "pelati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-23-24", "zh": "belati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-25-26", "zh": "selati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-27-28", "zh": "salati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-29-30", "zh": "tilati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1419-31-34", "zh": "celaṃ、belako。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1419-35-39", "zh": "这里，celaṃ 是指衣服。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1419-40-43", "zh": "**pelako** 是指兔子。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1420-2-4", "zh": "khala，用于“动摇”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1420-5-6", "zh": "khalati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1420-7-8", "zh": "khalo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1420-9-15", "zh": "**khalo** 是指坏人、不善良的人、不正直的人、作恶的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1421-2-4", "zh": "khala，用于“积聚”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1421-5-6", "zh": "khalati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1421-7-8", "zh": "khalaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1421-9-13", "zh": "khalaṃ 是指用来堆放稻谷的那块圆形场地，也就是打谷场。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1421-14-23", "zh": "因为人们在那里把谷物 khalanti，也就是积聚起来、堆成谷堆，所以称为 khalaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1421-24-38", "zh": "“打谷场、谷仓、牲畜、田地，他都要经常前去照看”——这是用例。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1422-2-4", "zh": "gila，用于“吞咽”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1422-5-6", "zh": "gilati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1422-7-11", "zh": "那人吞下了骰子，自己却毫不察觉。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1423-2-4", "zh": "gala，用于“吃”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1423-5-6", "zh": "galati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1423-7-8", "zh": "galo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1423-9-14", "zh": "人们用它来 galanti，也就是吃、吞咽，所以叫 galo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1423-15-19", "zh": "**galo** 指的是脖子。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1424-2-5", "zh": "sala、salla，用于“快速行进”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1424-6-8", "zh": "āsugati 就是快速行进。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1424-9-10", "zh": "salati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1424-11-12", "zh": "sallati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1424-13-14", "zh": "sallaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1424-15-30", "zh": "这里，“sallaṃ、usu、saro、sallo、kaṇḍo、tejano”这些都是同义词，都指箭。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1425-2-4", "zh": "khola，用于“行走受阻”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1425-5-6", "zh": "kholati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1426-2-5", "zh": "gile，用于“喜乐消退”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1426-6-7", "zh": "gilāyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1426-8-11", "zh": "gilāno、gelaññaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1426-12-15", "zh": "**gilāno** 是指不健康的人，也就是病人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1426-16-26", "zh": "律中也说：“我并非不健康。”", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1426-27-39", "zh": "义注中也说：“‘我并非**不健康**’，意思是我没有生病。”", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1427-2-4", "zh": "mile，用于“身体萎靡下垂”义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1427-5-6", "zh": "milāyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1427-7-12", "zh": "milāyano、milāyanto、milāyamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1428-2-4", "zh": "kele，用于“执为己有”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1428-5-15", "zh": "mamāyanaṃ 是指出于贪爱和邪见而执取“这是我的”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1428-16-17", "zh": "kelāyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1428-18-21", "zh": "你把什么当作自己的东西？", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1429-2-11", "zh": "sala，用于“动摇”和“防护”义；vala、valla，用于“动摇”等义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1429-12-15", "zh": "这里的 ca 字，是要兼顾“防护”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1429-16-17", "zh": "salati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1429-18-19", "zh": "kusalaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1429-20-21", "zh": "valati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1429-22-23", "zh": "vallati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1429-24-25", "zh": "vallūro。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1430-2-12", "zh": "其中，kusalaṃ（善）是指：它使可鄙的恶法动摇、震动、毁灭，所以叫 kusalaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1430-13-21", "zh": "善人们用它来关闭、防护、堵住可鄙的恶道之门，所以叫 kusalaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1430-22-30", "zh": "人们防护、守护它，不让乌鸦、老鹰等动物吃掉，所以叫 vallūro（干肉）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1431-2-5", "zh": "mala、malla，用于“持有”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1431-6-7", "zh": "malati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1431-8-9", "zh": "malaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1431-10-11", "zh": "mallati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1431-12-13", "zh": "mallo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1432-2-5", "zh": "bhala、bhalla，用于“呵责”“伤害”“给予”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1432-6-7", "zh": "bhalati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1432-8-9", "zh": "bhallati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1433-2-4", "zh": "kala，用于“计数”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1433-5-6", "zh": "kalati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1433-7-10", "zh": "kalā、kālo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1434-2-6", "zh": "这里，**kalā** 是指十六分之一等部分。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1434-7-21", "zh": "**kālo**：它可以用“已经过去了这么多”等方式来计算、计量，所以叫 kālo，也就是上午等时段。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1435-2-4", "zh": "kalla，用于“无声”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1435-5-6", "zh": "asaddo（无声）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1435-7-8", "zh": "nissaddo（寂静无声）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1435-9-10", "zh": "kallati。", "confidence": 90}
